* SN7476 behavioral model for Ten-Tec assembly 80308
* Pin order follows the 16-pin package:
* 1CLK 1PREn 1CLRn 1J VCC 2CLK 2PREn 2CLRn 2J 2Qbar 2Q 2K GND 1Qbar 1Q 1K
*
* Functional XSPICE model, not a Texas Instruments transistor-level model.
* The physical SN7476 changes state on the high-to-low clock transition; each
* external clock is inverted before the rising-edge XSPICE J-K primitive.
.subckt SN7476_80308 1CLK 1PREN 1CLRN 1J VCC 2CLK 2PREN 2CLRN 2J 2QB 2Q 2K GND 1QB 1Q 1K

* Original TTL inputs were intentionally allowed to float high on assembly 80308.
R1CLK 1CLK VCC 50k
R1PRE 1PREN VCC 50k
R1CLR 1CLRN VCC 50k
R1J 1J VCC 50k
R1K 1K VCC 50k
R2CLK 2CLK VCC 50k
R2PRE 2PREN VCC 50k
R2CLR 2CLRN VCC 50k
R2J 2J VCC 50k
R2K 2K VCC 50k

AADC [1CLK 1PREN 1CLRN 1J 1K 2CLK 2PREN 2CLRN 2J 2K] [D1CLK D1PREN D1CLRN D1J D1K D2CLK D2PREN D2CLRN D2J D2K] ADC_TTL_80308
.model ADC_TTL_80308 adc_bridge(in_low=0.8 in_high=2.0 rise_delay=2n fall_delay=2n)

* Active-low preset and clear become active-high set and reset.
A1CLK D1CLK D1CLKF INV_80308
A1PRE D1PREN D1SET INV_80308
A1CLR D1CLRN D1RESET INV_80308
A2CLK D2CLK D2CLKF INV_80308
A2PRE D2PREN D2SET INV_80308
A2CLR D2CLRN D2RESET INV_80308
.model INV_80308 d_inverter(rise_delay=2n fall_delay=2n input_load=5p)

* J K CLK SET RESET Q Qbar
AJK1 D1J D1K D1CLKF D1SET D1RESET D1Q D1QB JK_80308
AJK2 D2J D2K D2CLKF D2SET D2RESET D2Q D2QB JK_80308
.model JK_80308 d_jkff(clk_delay=10n set_delay=15n reset_delay=15n ic=0 rise_delay=8n fall_delay=8n)

ADAC [D2QB D2Q D1QB D1Q] [N2QB N2Q N1QB N1Q] DAC_TTL_80308
.model DAC_TTL_80308 dac_bridge(out_low=0.15 out_high=3.5 out_undef=1.4 input_load=5p t_rise=10n t_fall=8n)

* Scale the DAC levels with package supply so an unpowered calibrator cannot
* drive the OUT or DEFEAT wiring through an ideal model source.
B2QB 2QB GND V={V(N2QB,GND)*min(max(V(VCC,GND)/5.6,0),1)}
B2Q  2Q  GND V={V(N2Q,GND)*min(max(V(VCC,GND)/5.6,0),1)}
B1QB 1QB GND V={V(N1QB,GND)*min(max(V(VCC,GND)/5.6,0),1)}
B1Q  1Q  GND V={V(N1Q,GND)*min(max(V(VCC,GND)/5.6,0),1)}

* Approximate package current, included to load the zener regulator realistically.
BIcc VCC GND I={48m*tanh(max(V(VCC,GND),0)/0.5)}
.ends SN7476_80308
